  "declared_vs_shipped": {
    "note": "`PROFILES` declares more cell classes than some units actually carry, because extract_cel_profiles.py only emits a member profile for a declared class that has an edge inside the module. PLM is declared for the touch-avoidance circuit but has no edge in the adult reconstruction, so the v2.27 unit ships 10 members; merged across all eight reconstructions PLM does have edges, so this series measures 11. Both are right -- the unit NAME is identical, which is exactly why the gap is recorded here.",
